<p>Fire an orb of negative energy towards a spot within range <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 6, 6, 7.</acronym></p><p>When the orb reaches its destination, it will teleport you to its location.</p><p>The speed of the projectile (<acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">200%, 286%, 336%, 372%, 400%</acronym>) increases with your movement speed</p>